### ===============================
### 1️⃣ Enroll in FREE course
### POST /api/enrollment/free/:courseId
### ===============================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollment/free/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ===============================
### 2️⃣ Create Razorpay Order (PAID course)
### POST /api/enrollment/create-order/:courseId
### ===============================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollment/create-order/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### ===============================
### 3️⃣ Verify Razorpay Payment
### POST /api/enrollment/verify-payment
### ===============================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollment/verify-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "razorpay_order_id": "order_XXXXXXXXXXXX",
  "razorpay_payment_id": "pay_XXXXXXXXXXXX",
  "razorpay_signature": "generated_signature_here",
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}"
}

### ===============================
### 4️⃣ Get My Enrolled Courses
### GET /api/enrollment/my-courses
### ===============================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollment/my-courses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ===============================
### 5️⃣ Get Enrollment Details for a Course
### GET /api/enrollment/course/:courseId
### ===============================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/enrollment/course/{{courseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
